### Data Use Agreement

All participants provided written informed consent for public data sharing. 
Users are required to:
1. Cite this data descriptor in any publications using the dataset
2. Respect participant privacy by not attempting re-identification
3. Follow repository-specific terms of use

Technical Validation data and analysis code are available at [GitHub/OSF URL].
